{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/09/8023217/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/09/8023217/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お家の庭にいくつかある花壇の一角＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここに毎年、ユリの花は咲きます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/09/8023217/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなーり報告遅くなっちゃったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、乃木どこで、聖誕祭をして頂きました(*^_^*)有難うございます＞_＜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/09/8023217/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/09/8023217/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(お母さんから写メ送って貰ったんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白光しちゃっててわかりづらくてごめんなさい(;_;)  )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうなんです...実は、料理出来るんです(*^o^*)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー今、意外～！って思ったひと～っ(｀･д･´)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んまぁ普段がこれですからね！(^_^;)なんかフワッと生きてますし (  ^o^  );あはは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カットされちゃった料理のでは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は、生駒ちゃんから100点を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もらっていたんです( ^_^  )；"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎朝自分で作ってた学校のお弁当、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふりかけとかは、もちろんスーパー戦隊でねっ(o^^o)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"運動とかも...意外と出来るんです(^_^;)てへへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"書道や絵画や作文などでも賞をとってたり...基本、何でも..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ま、任せてくださいっ("},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/09/8023217/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"^^"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/09/8023217/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":")！はいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幼い頃から、自然と何事も自分でするようになって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰かに頼ったり甘えたりするのがいやで、出来なかったときには"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"強く自分に悔しいって思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5人兄妹でも、歳が離れていたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"唯一何でも言えたのは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっこ違いのお兄ちゃんだけ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなお兄ちゃんの影響で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スーパー戦隊シリーズが好きになり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2次元や2.5次元にはまり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小学生の頃、毎日パソコンばかりしていて、視力も 最高に悪くなって^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学になって、親にパソコンを取り上げられたんです（＾∇＾）はっはっは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも、ネット回線を切られるというっ!素晴らしいっ!生きてけないよっ(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だがしかし私は諦めなかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしは普通科に進まなかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お勉強ならパソコンいじってもいいだろう(*^p^*)くっくっくっ  と。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"資格はそういう訳です;  ;"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紹介された他にもまだあるんですが、謎にとりました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、VTRの一番最後の写真は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学生のときの。(*^_^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/09/8023217/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで戦隊ポーズしてるの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気付いたかなぁ？？（＾＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小学校、中学校、高校と、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"吹奏楽一本だった私。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"厳しい練習で、休みもなく、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"台風の日でも、雪の日でも、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"室内だから大丈夫^_−☆！って謎の自信で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日練習がありました（ ;  ; ）笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けど、そんなおかげで吹奏楽の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲間とは、ほんとに仲良くなって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サクソフォンパートのみんなで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「ブラバン戦隊サックスレンジャー」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていうのをつくって組んでいたんです(*^_^*)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それがあの写真ですっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、私は「ブラック担当っ！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その頃から、追加戦士ラヴ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サクパでアンサンブルコンテストに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出場することになったときは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つらい練習の日々だったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レンジャーのみんなであのポーズを決めて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも気合い入れてました^^（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにそのとき吹いたのがクロード・アシル・ドビュッシー作曲のプレリュード。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私にとって思い入れの深い曲です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学二年で、ドビュッシーと出会って、印象主義音楽派を勉強し始め、その世界観に魅了されて、クラシックがより好きになり、毎日夢中で浸ってました！ 西洋ラヴ！（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだもドビュッシー展を見に行きましたが、感動しましたあ～^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてその頃から負けず嫌いで、毎日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰よりも早く学校に行って、夜は誰よりも遅く残って自主練をして。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしは、ピアノを始めるのも遅かったし、才能があるわけでもなかったけど、努力だけは裏切らないって信じてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日ものすごく勉強して細かくノートにメモしていて、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまたま部室に落ちてたそのノートを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先輩が読んで、感心してくれて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それがコンサートミストレスを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"決める、決め手となったって話を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞いて、努力は報われるんだなって思ったんです(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/09/8023217/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コンミスや学指揮になってからは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"演奏を指導する立場になり、自分が練習する時間が少なくなっても、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"指導する人間がへたっぴじゃダメだからって、もっともっと努力しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校に入ってからは、大好きな音楽の視野を広め"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"吹奏楽部と兼部して、軽音楽部にも入部。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"演奏することも、歌うことも大好き♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"吹奏楽では、乃木坂に入る直前まで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校野球の応援に明け暮れていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/09/8023217/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな感じです＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも頑張ります(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなっ、有難う♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/09/8023217/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/09/8023217/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/09/8023217/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/09/8023217/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}